{"name":"Aebleskiver","hex":"#e6d3b6","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Æbleskiver","blocks":[{"text":"Æbleskiver are spherical Danish snacks made from fried batter. The name literally means \"apple slices\" in Danish, although slices of apples are not an ingredient in present-day versions. The crust is similar in texture to European pancakes, but with a light and fluffy interior similar to a Yorkshire pudding. The English language spelling is usually aebleskiver, ebleskiver or ebelskiver."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/%C3%86bleskriver_%2854997580931%29.jpg/330px-%C3%86bleskriver_%2854997580931%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%86bleskiver"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/AebleskiverFront.jpg/500px-AebleskiverFront.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/AebleskiverFront.jpg/500px-AebleskiverFront.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Top view of an æbleskive pan","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAebleskiverFront.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/%C3%86bleskiver.jpg/500px-%C3%86bleskiver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/%C3%86bleskiver.jpg/1280px-%C3%86bleskiver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/%C3%86bleskiver.jpg/500px-%C3%86bleskiver.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An æbleskive with jam","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%C3%86bleskiver.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/t